<workout_file>
	<author>Jarvis Chau (via TrainingPeaks)</author>
	<name>Aerobic Ride (60 mins)</name>
	<description>One of TrainingPeaks Virtual&apos;s classic workouts:
Aerobic Ride.

Perfect to recruit slow-twitch endurance muscle fibres. Alternating 5 minute blocks of Zone 2 and Zone 3 throughout - no fuss, no drama - just a solid workout. Simple, but effective.</description>
	<sportType>bike</sportType>
	<tags/>
